     2| * IVX IA Chat Execution Mode — Live-polling hook
     3| *
     4| * FINAL IVX IA CHAT EXECUTION MODE mandate (owner 2026-07-19):
     5| *   "Stream live execution status."
     6| *
     7| * When the backend returns HTTP 202 + `executionStatus` payload for an
     8| * execution-mode prompt (fix/build/deploy/audit/QA/refactor/migration/
     9| * create module/create app/senior developer), the Expo chat renders a
    10| * live-polling execution console bubble. This hook polls the worker job
    11| * statusUrl on an interval and updates the bubble with the real stage,
    12| * progress %, files changed, tests, commitSha, deployId, and verified
    13| * evidence — never fabricated.
    14| */
    15|import { useCallback, useEffect, useRef, useState } from 'react';
    16|
    17|// IVX canonical API base. Reads EXPO_PUBLIC_IVX_API_BASE_URL (owner-AI routing
    18|// env) with a fallback to the production host, matching the rest of the app
    19|// (see expo/lib/ivx-supabase-client.ts, expo/lib/video-feed.ts, etc.).
    20|const BASE_URL = (process.env.EXPO_PUBLIC_IVX_API_BASE_URL || 'https://api.ivxholding.com').replace(/\/+$/, '');
